</span></ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> contractual term. </span><span><ix:nonNumeric id="F_c4e7d14b-4ad4-4a9c-af07-d2405c6dda7f" contextRef="C_383ac086-2b9c-497d-90ba-555521465e72" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfShareBasedCompensationStockOptionsActivityTableTextBlock" escape="true" continuedAt="F_c4e7d14b-4ad4-4a9c-af07-d2405c6dda7f_1"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The following table summarizes the Company&#8217;s stock option activity during the </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">six months ended June 30, 2026: </span></ix:nonNumeric></span><span style=""></span></p><div style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:continuation id="F_c4e7d14b-4ad4-4a9c-af07-d2405c6dda7f_1"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p>
